## Title: |cff9b8cffMello|rUI Frame Effects
## Notes: MelloUI's Frame Effects: your heals as light flying from your cast bar to the frame you heal, and your group's big moments on their frames -- a roar's square ripples, Shield Wall's steel, Last Stand's heartbeat, an immunity's barrier. Switch them on or off in MelloUI (/mello); untick it here to not load it at all.
